  <data name="PageHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>3 Budget and expenses</value></data>
  <data name="PageBody" xml:space="preserve"><value>Plot fees covered most of the running costs. 38 of 40 plots were let all season, and the waiting list grew to eleven households. The board kept the fee at €45 per plot so that nobody had to give up a plot for cost reasons. Water was the clearest overrun: because of the dry spell in July and August the main tap ran almost every evening, and the water bill came to €1,385 instead of the planned €1,240.</value></data>
